    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3931975addded9c6bb38dd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "桔梗的花语是『不变的爱』『真诚』。\n而西洋菜的花语，则是\n『不屈之力』『安定』『稳健』『忍耐力』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b27f5bf443411eab0d3adfca652e51c210aba90731ea1e82d7d634243208129",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:777f24dbc97ea445aaccc6f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8cff799b3896ea5a6b72ec7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两种都是我小时候和母亲一起种过的花，\n我觉得其中蕴含的话语，\n正适合表现我的长处……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c70f8d5eb2184f7293bdb80253a40ce92622c7b1e1ffcf4bd88a93042c93afe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a2c3a30dd32f16e66910a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此。没想到竟然是原创的",
      "source_fingerprint": "4531049db8709b186a2c33811d9cc70993abc81ccd1953b2c4915151ea8bbbfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d619f5701b2f4d3abf7ae9bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af0ccfdee200f27f9b37fcf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了同时融入二者，\n我便把它设计成了一朵原创的花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1af7b46faada5f934b6519e0e194ac77cccedc03280c15918683b51c725159f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32df2f2419ea887834c4a1a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（咦？她好像格外高兴……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "568354097b336aff0f932199cd4963947ec87d2b4e5eb507895e870677cba778",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190835e998d0ef299d726673",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377148ec881dec7b2b90334b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出乎意料……！\n呵呵，您能这么想我的目的就达到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b48d7b207527437af007f49af5543bff440ed706649755e416fdc190f183ca3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a17df5914b94d2cfcea1140",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "设计胜负服时，空中救世主也曾干劲十足地说\n无论如何都要加入这朵花。\n我问她除了花语是否还有其他用意――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae53e03253818e0bb404456a89b2e83d969fbbb5245620ac9e282fe18c7bf70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366d8ee8a6050ac435f3368b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先请简单介绍一下自己",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a0db70779e81e71fe98ab4a936aacc6ef115e5b00b3e916d343621e76ffc10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11fb4452436891e0adbfe529",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应空中救世主的要求，我们参考过去的\n报道列出问题，决定先进行一次彩排。",
      "source_fingerprint": "854e1ffd8feb036a1445d1ba55e2f140b2677cfaa6177d5c6360826bebe9a87c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec49a0a1efcf2ce809012b7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这、这个……该怎么说呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52463f9db76c149ef727733a38e177cb8574f06493972cd8f1595626cdeb8ebb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8bfadfa163724bfb77893e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b5fdc49accf5a5905a1b236",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在胜负服中加入原创的花，\n不是非常突破常规吗……\n您不这么觉得吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe8ca1843daaba429f993550557e3ef0db378177afe1a9296c4748f5217b6ad4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0e02eecd4598ac82b0ebf10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对一朵洁白可爱的花她竟有如此强烈的自信，\n令我一时不知如何回答……。\n不过这样倒也很有空中救世主的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd8831f60ee5ac020e22d015fa25f3e9d05e4aa510f38376615044bd9153ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8a9fc99d7d1288cca88637",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "问完所有问题，彩排结束。\n我评价她的回答充分展现了空中救世主的诚恳与认真。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe90d5862d424aa4f3f5cf8c8d820d786b87b79b6ac818ed37b46455264e3463",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1da0e53f8d8570f92a912cf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个嘛……别忘了像今天这样微笑",
      "source_fingerprint": "af76b76c3820593d7efadab481c770a3f5607b77ff4b9c8a8186ed2c4590a038",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
