      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e533c1adc4ade3efc78753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说得也是。\n听说深呼吸能让副交感神经占据主导，\n从而安定情绪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ac401d7ead870663bf73bbcbed9467498d105eca542a3b4ff943a36f1d725d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d4f2d472dd6286ad9e0df92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04ec9ebbf43c82ce792e407",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会随时确认自己的呼吸是否变浅，\n提醒自己深吸一口气。\n谢谢您的建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0b96b3c94192cd02b164652e36c3bbc43a573e25a7dcf1baf2a2be56a55a31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac1ea0163951f1d7549f7e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主立刻拿出记事本，\n写下『注意深呼吸』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f86561a85ba8639fc4c72c415f604baa59381353594c67d40c244c96d0552261",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be646462ee74f7c9287542f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周围的人都说你是一位怎样的赛马娘？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd9b2c91638cd65dc342d5d63e49f9a62dc55ff2cc1848ef1383d2d44e55189",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:165adbbe08e37f04266e8db9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
